OL,3,AWonky wych elm in County Down crowned
OL,4,ATree of the Year
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trust's Northern Ireland director
OL,7,FJohn Martin said he was rooting for the
OL,8,F"whimsical" tree to win and said tens
OL,9,Fof thousands of people across the UK
OL,10,Fhad clearly felt the same.
